SUMMARY:McCaskey Combined Choirs – FREE
DESCRIPTION:6:30 pm • Steinman Hall Celebrate the vibrant sound of the J.
 P. McCaskey High School Combined Choirs in this free concert at the Ware C
 enter in Lancaster. The ensemble\, made up of the McCaskey Vocal Ensemble 
 and McCaskey Voices of Freedom\, will present a diverse program featuring 
 both accompanied and a cappella choral music. To complement the evening’
 s art exhibit\, the choirs will perform music from African culture\, showc
 asing the students’ versatility and the range of musical styles they stu
 dy throughout the school year\, including both sacred and secular music. A
 s J.P. McCaskey High School approaches its celebration of 90 years of chor
 al music in Lancaster\, come support these talented student singers and ex
 perience an evening of music\, culture\, and community. Admission: Free an
 d open to the public! Accessibility: Sensory-friendly accommodations will 
 be available. Please get in touch with Barry Kornhauser to learn more.\n\n
